            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadá' iwa xeér ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Eliya nguwa ar tleemuú wa slai gawaá doori ar fur'ár bambaao, Eliya nee Elisha ta baraá loohírí dirii', ta Gilgalír daahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya Elisha guna báy, «Gám na'ás diirí meeteek, asma aníng AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iga ya/aáw Beteli.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Elisha iri oó', «Adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ir hotaatina nee adoodá' kuúng tar slafa, ar looeemaawo aníng kuúng u baloó geexawaaká.» Naagáy tay alkoné' ay Beteli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
